      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 8,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "`denoise` on the Stage 2 KSampler is the strength dial.\n\n- **0.25 - 0.35** clean up artifacts, keep everything\n- **0.45 - 0.55** rework the background, keep the pose\n- **0.70 +** effectively a new image\n\nStart at 0.45 and move in steps of 0.05."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
